            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# LidPulse 1.2.1

- 修正開啟 Logo 控制後，螢幕亮度可能閃動或突然跳級嘅問題。
- Logo 燈效更新同螢幕亮度調節分開處理，保留 macOS 原本嘅平滑亮度過渡。

---

- Fixes screen brightness flickering or jumping while logo control is enabled.
- Keeps logo effect updates separate from display brightness adjustments, preserving macOS brightness transitions.
]]></description>
