        <item>
            <title>1.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:25:20 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# LidPulse 1.2.0

- 合蓋亮燈時會要求顯示器熄屏。
- 合蓋期間以設定亮度固定發光，暫停音訊分析同呼吸、音樂及 AI 燈效動畫；開蓋後恢復原本模式。
- 減少合蓋期間嘅定時更新，保留 30 分鐘上限、高溫同低電量保護。

Mac 會保持清醒，其他程式仍然可以運作；實際耗電及發熱會受其他工作影響。

---

- Requests display sleep during closed-lid lighting.
- Holds your selected brightness with audio analysis and animated effects paused. Opening the lid restores your previous mode.
- Reduces periodic work while preserving the 30-minute limit, thermal protection and low-battery cutoff.

Your Mac stays awake and other apps can continue running. Power consumption and heat depend on other workloads.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/siumiu1968/LidPulse/releases/download/v1.2.0/LidPulse-1.2.0.dmg" length="3239572" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="C31w3DuDqkl8xdxbIhYyOO96OUxj8HpWag5XAaU/GgxsJ+WBWGhQOnM/XeVrTf5MmhnpUmxcigSHt6EhSgdBDg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:37:31 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# LidPulse 1.1.1

- 合蓋保持發光嘅上限調整至每次 30 分鐘。
- 系統報告嚴重或危急熱壓力時，會停止合蓋亮燈並恢復正常睡眠。
- 電池供電時，電量低於 20% 亦會提早停止。

---

- Extended closed-lid lighting sessions to 30 minutes.
- Sessions stop and normal sleep resumes when macOS reports serious or critical thermal pressure.
- Sessions also stop below 20% charge while running on battery.
]]></description>
